The `main` function is responsible for updating the configuration settings periodically using the `update_config` method of the `ConfigLoader` class. It uses a while loop to continuously fetch updated configuration settings from the API endpoint until the program exits or an error occurs. The code logs informative messages when the process starts, finishes, or encounters issues during configuration updating.

