Note that the `Initialize` method should be called only once at the application startup to initialize the available ciphers and modes.

### Advanced usage

The `CryptographyHelper` class also provides methods for generating random keys and IVs, as well as methods for encrypting and decrypting files. You can use these methods to perform more advanced encryption operations, such as streaming encrypted data or reading/writing encrypted files.

```csharp
