* We've used dependency injection to decouple the HTTP server from the Kafka consumer, making it easier to test and maintain the code.
* We've implemented a custom data structure to cache the incoming messages and prevent unnecessary data fetching.
* We've used encryption to protect the data before caching it.
* We've implemented rate limiting to prevent abuse of the service.

