The user can add or update configurations for individual sensors using the `addConfiguration` and `removeConfiguration` methods, respectively. The `getDefaultConfiguration` method returns the default configuration for sensors with no explicit configuration. Finally, the `copySensorData` utility function efficiently copies large data chunks from sensors into a `std::vector<std::unique_ptr<uint8_t[]>>` structure.

