This implementation also uses a `PaymentGatewayAPI` class to fetch transaction metadata for each transaction ID using an external payment gateway API. The API key and endpoint URL are passed as constructor arguments to the `PaymentGatewayAPI` class, and the `fetchTransactionMetadata` method is used to fetch the transaction metadata for a given transaction ID.

