* The `ConstructHtmlString` method takes a Pokémon ID as input and uses the three methods to retrieve the weaknesses, weather effects, and terrain effects for that Pokémon. It then constructs an HTML string that displays these information in a list format. If there is an error in making any of the requests or parsing the responses, null is returned.
